 "commit": "653723ae2c60fee7cc72dd2602ed7b9450a41e1a",
 "observations": [
  "Darker brown streaks run across the crown in every view, on both backends.",
  "A dark brown patch sits at the side of the neck in the three-quarter and full-body views. It is the floppy ear, which B2 asks to be darker than the coat.",
  "From the low hero angle a pale band runs along the lower lip line, and the tips of the front teeth show at the chin.",
  "At the extreme eye and nose close-ups (a 20 degree field a few tens of centimetres away) the face and muzzle strands read as flat, hard-edged ribbons radiating from the skin. From the face close-up outward they read as fur.",
  "Stray hairs stand out of the head's outline against the sky in the face close-up.",
  "OpenGL and Vulkan show the same pose and the same coat; the visible differences are the wind-blown grass blades in front of the camera.",
  "The first Vulkan capture of the full-body view showed near-black, straight-edged patches on the muzzle and flank. They came from the opaque shadow copy reading the wrong rows on Vulkan, fixed in f90243d9e; every Vulkan picture here is after that fix."
 ],
